i chhalaang mein इकाई do hi rehti hai, aur dahaai saat se aath hoti hai: bahattar se bayaasi. Ab pachpan se sau tak paintalis ki chhalaangein kaise lagaoge?","move":"reteach","ui":{"ask":{"text":"55 + 45 = 100 ko number line pe chhalaangon se dikhao.","itemId":"c3-maths-ch03-t02-i11"},"tray":"studio","answerForm":"words","verdict":"not_yet","studioSlot":{"state":"revealed","kind":"whiteboard"}},"moduleCommands":[],"studio":null,"screen":{"chips":[],"ask":"55 + 45 = 100 ko number line pe chhalaangon se dikhao.","pad":false,"whiteboard":null,"tray":"studio","answerForm":"words","studio":"revealed: whiteboard drawing with 12 line, 2 circle; written: \"0\" \"55\" \"100\""},"end":false,"speakNow":null,"reasons":{"phase":"practice","turn":14,"hintLevel":0,"unclear":0,"verdict":"not_yet","classification":{"outcome":"incorrect","confidence":0.98,"flags":[],"misconceptionId":null},"item":{"id":"c3-maths-ch03-t02-i06","kind":"predict"},"probe":null,"kt":[],"skills":{},"flagged":{"c3-maths-ch03-t02-m-both-digits-make-ten":1},"guard":{"caught":[],"rewritten":false,"replaced":false,"agent":[]},"note":{"nonAnswer":false,"intent":"answer_wrong"},"timings":[{"k":"chat","d":"grok-4-1-fast-non-reasoning","st":200,"ms":818},{"k":"chat","d":"taxila-fast","st":200,"ms":1414},{"k":"chat","d":"taxila-fast","st":200,"ms":1666},{"k":"@classified","ms":1747},{"k":"chat","d":"taxila-gpt6","st":200,"ms":3859},{"k":"@agent","ms":5628},{"k":"@kernel","ms":5628},{"k":"@replied","ms":5696}]},"ms":5755}],"errors":[],"state":{"c3-maths-ch03-t02-s1":"understood","c3-maths-ch03-t02-s2":"partly","c3-maths-ch03-t02-s3":"not"},"misconceptionsHeld":["c3-maths-ch03-t02-m-ten-jump-to-decade","c3-maths-ch03-t02-m-both-digits-make-ten"],"learning":[],"end":{"summary":"Practised making 100 with tens numbers and two-digit numbers.\nAnswered 30 + 70-type partners correctly in 3 unaided attempts.\nAnswered 65 + 35-type partners correctly in 2 of 5 unaided attempts.\nUsed 1-jump and 10-jump number-line steps correctly in 1 of 2 attempts.\nThe digit-sum mix-up for 65 was corrected later in the lesson; teach-back was not passed.","parentNote":"Vihaan practised finding partners that make 100 and explaining jumps on a number line. They used step counting to explain that 87 needs three jumps to reach 90 and that 95 needs five more to reach 100. There was one mix-up where the digits of 65 were combined to make 45, but this was corrected later. At home, use numbers such as 65, 72, and 84 and ask, “How many more to make 100?” then draw tens and ones jumps.","did":{"title":"Making 100 and jumps on the number line","shortTitle":"Jumps to 100","cards":[{"kind":"item","ask":"48 ke saath kya milaayein ki 100 ban jaaye?","answer":"बावन?","tick":true,"withHelp":false,"turnSeq":26},{"kind":"item","ask":"Batter 87 run pe hai. Century ke liye aur kitne run chahiye?","answer":"तेरह!","tick":false,"withHelp":false,"turnSeq":18},{"kind":"item","ask":"Bholu 65 pe hai. Woh 5 ki chhalaang lagake 70 pe pahunchta hai. Ab 100 tak 10-10 ki kitni chhalaang chahiye?","answer":"तीन!","tick":true,"withHelp":false,"turnSeq":10}],"nextTitle":"Halves and quarters as equal shares","face":"warm","teacher":{"id":"asha","name":"Asha","characterName":"Asha","addressedAs":"Asha didi","pronouns":{"subject":"she","object":"her","possessive":"her"},"voice":"marin","role":"AI teacher","lookRev":1,"signatureColor":"#3E7C74"},"revoiceSeq":26},"facts":{"topic":"Making 100 and jumps on the number line","minutes":1.8,"teachbackPassed":false,"skills":[{"skill":"Find the partner that makes 100 with a tens number (30 + 70)","attempts":3,"unaidedCorrect":3},{"skill":"Find the partner that makes 100 with any 2-digit number (65 + 35)","attempts":5,"unaidedCorrect":2},{"skill":"Use jumps of 1 and 10 on a number line to reach 100","attempts":2,"unaidedCorrect":1}],"misconceptions":[{"belief":"For a number like 65, makes both digits add to 10, giving 45 (65 + 45 = 110)","timesSeen":1,"correctAfterLastSeen":1}]}},"start":{"ms":4402,"