ee2f4b5e4a:tool:33:5557","beat":"explain","skillId":"c3-maths-ch03-t02-s2","at":"2026-10-15T04:06:46.095Z","board":"written board: \"75 + ? = 95\" \"95 + 5 = 100\" \"48 + ? = 100\""},{"seq":10,"intentId":"b97d8844-6847-480d-9c7d-02ee2f4b5e4a:tool:35:13161","beat":"explain","skillId":"c3-maths-ch03-t02-s3","at":"2026-10-15T04:06:53.694Z","board":"drawing with 9 line, 1 circle; written: \"0\" \"72\""},{"seq":11,"intentId":"b97d8844-6847-480d-9c7d-02ee2f4b5e4a:tool:37:20583","beat":"explain","skillId":"c3-maths-ch03-t02-s3","at":"2026-10-15T04:07:01.179Z","board":"drawing with 12 line, 2 circle; written: \"0\" \"55\" \"100\""}],"lane2":{"teacher":"agent","agent":{"plan":"Das ki chhalaang sudhaaro; sau tak chhalaangein parakho","notes":[],"posed":["c3-maths-ch03-t02-i01","c3-maths-ch03-t02-i07","c3-maths-ch03-t02-i03","c3-maths-ch03-t02-i05","c3-maths-ch03-t02-i10","c3-maths-ch03-t02-i08","c3-maths-ch03-t02-i04","c3-maths-ch03-t02-i06","c3-maths-ch03-t02-i11"],"skill":"c3-maths-ch03-t02-s3","turns":[{"who":"child","text":"नहीं, गोलू गलत है। 60 और 4 से 64 होता है, 100 नहीं।"},{"who":"teacher","text":"Bilkul, saath aur chaar se chaunsath banta hai, sau nahi. Ab painsath mein kitna jodo ki sau bane?"},{"who":"child","text":"पैंतालीस!"},{"who":"teacher","text":"Tumne paintaalis kaha. Par painsath mein paintaalis jodne se ek sau das banta hai, sau se zyada. Pehle painsath se sattar tak kitne chahiye?"},{"who":"child","text":"पाँच?"},{"who":"teacher","text":"Paanch se painsath sattar hota hai. Par sau tak abhi jaana hai. Sattar se sau tak das das ki kitni chhalaang chahiye?"},{"who":"child","text":"तीन!"},{"who":"teacher","text":"Haan, sattar se sau tak das ki teen chhalaangein hain. Ye tees hue; pehle wale paanch milakar paintis. Ab ballebaaz ke sataaasi run hain. Sau run poore karne ke liye aur kitne chahiye?"},{"who":"child","text":"इक्कीस?"},{"who":"teacher","text":"Tumne ikkees kaha. Sattaasi mein ikkees jodo, toh sau se aage nikal jaate hain. Cricket mein pehle nabbe run tak chalte hain. Sattaasi se nabbe tak kitne run chahiye?"},{"who":"child","text":"तीन! क्योंकि सत्तासी से नब्बे तक तीन कदम हैं।"},{"who":"teacher","text":"Haan, sattasi se nabbe tak teen kadam hain. Ab nabbe se sau tak kitne run chahiye?"},{"who":"child","text":"दस!"},{"who":"teacher","text":"Haan, nabbe se sau tak das run chahiye. Pehle teen run, phir das run. Dono milakar century ke liye aur kitne run chahiye?"},{"who":"child","text":"तेरह!"},{"who":"teacher","text":"Haan, teen aur das milkar terah run hue. Ab ek farq socho. Sattar mein tees jodte hain, par pachhattar mein pachchees jodte hain. Doosri jodi mein dahaai saat aur do kyun hain?"},{"who":"child","text":"बीस!"},{"who":"teacher","text":"Haan, tumne bees pakda. Pachhattar mein bees jodo, toh pachaanve bante hain. Ab sau tak aur kitne chahiye?"},{"who":"child","text":"पाँच! क्योंकि 95 और 5 मिलके 100 बनता है।"},{"who":"teacher","text":"Haan, pachaanve aur paanch milkar sau bante hain. Isliye pachhattar ko pehle bees, phir paanch chahiye. Ab athtalees ke saath kitna milaao ki sau bane?"},{"who":"child","text":"बावन?"},{"who":"teacher","text":"Haan, baavan! Athtalees aur baavan milkar sau bante hain. Ab Bholu bahattar par hai. Das ki chhalaang lagaye, toh kahaan pahunchega?"},{"who":"child","text":"बहत्तर?"},{"who":"teacher","text":"Bahattar par hi rehna, matlab chhalaang lagi hi nahi. Das ki chhalaang mein इकाई do hi rehti hai, aur dahaai saat se aath hoti hai: bahattar se bayaasi. Ab pachpan se sau tak paintalis ki chhalaangein kaise lagaoge?"}],"usage":{"usd":0.08114,"tokens":52177},"boards":12,"lastMs":3860,"screen":{"on":"board","texts":["0","55","100"],"words":"the board shows a number line marked at 55 and 100; written on it: 0; 55; 100"},"learner":{"c3-maths-ch03-t02-s1":{"read":"understood","graded":[{"g":"correct","item":"c3-maths-ch03-t02-i01","kind":"practice"},{"g":"correct","item":"c3-maths-ch03-t02-i07","kind":"error_spot"}],"grades":["correct","correct"],"evidence":"Tens answer and Golu con